(7459493, 1182117, 175675, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> wonderful. just at the edge of cartoonery. (I realize this can''t be "the beautiful Lake Balaton" that all the Hungarians tell you about, but it''s the way I feel about it after learning it is only a few feet deep). </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I agree. It was shot on the Danube somewhere between Esztergom and Vac. It may have even been in Vac, my memory escapes me. We Have just been to Lake Balaton and it was beautiful.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: wonderful. just at the edge of cartoonery. (I realize this can''t be "the beautiful Lake Balaton" that all the Hungarians tell you about, but it''s the way I feel about it after learning it is only a few feet deep).  I agree. It was shot on the Danube somewhere between Esztergom and Vac. It may have even been in Vac, my memory escapes me. We Have just been to Lake Balaton and it was beautiful.', '2016-06-08 20:19:51.000000', NULL, 0),
